            memorize the "perfect" answer: it is <em>muscle memory</em> to draw
            each one in <strong>under 3 minutes</strong>, then <em>adapt</em> to
            the prompt. The warmup drill lives in the
            <a href="../lessons/0006-warmup-copy-recall.html">warmup lesson</a
            >.`} />
